  *'Included Features '*

•DeFi Wallet supports the following developer features. Take advantage of these features in your applications by ;
   Integrating with DeFi Wallet SDK, or a library like web3-react.

  *'Multiple Access Points '*

•You can connect your dapps to DeFi Wallet on both mobile web (for iOS and Android) and desktop. 
    You can also onboard new    Users who do not yet have a wallet.

